    {
      "v": "\"Wowzer ! Je ne pourrais PAS descendre sur Terre plus vite !\" ",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "tRight"
    },
    {
      "v": "“LOL! I broke the sound barrier on my way down to Earth.”",
